-No human action is needed for the current kitchen foundation cards.
+No human action is requested yet. The active card is R0.01: the direct Sign in with ChatGPT provider. Its transport and Hermes patch are prepared; the authorization and Keychain vault sources are now compiled in the protected Secrets area. The actual protected runtime/identity/browser binding, live Keychain checks and native provider grant-reader connection are still pending. No consent flow has started.
+
+The real `toy doctor --deep --json` inventory now reports all eight canonical service accounts absent, including `_toy_control`. The canonical protected bootstrap source and CLI guards are prepared. Actual Directory Service planning/root account installation, protected runtime and denial gates are still required before starting the sign-in host. R0.04 permits only an unavoidable macOS administrator identity dialog as Johan's step; no such dialog or manual setup request is pending yet.
+
+The next specified human-only action is Toy's independent ChatGPT identity/consent step, after the actual secure flow is started and ready. Existing builder/Codex grants will not be copied. The no-credit requirement is binding: Toy's per-app zero-credit control must have a real readback before inference. This is implementation work and verification, not a new spending preference question.
 
 At the relevant gated card, prepare the concrete flows for only the actions specified in BUILD-PLAN and LOGINS-READY: unavoidable identity/OS consent, protected secret pastes, source-policy consent, signing/device interactions and physical observations. Previously recorded ready accounts must be reverified before use. Never place a credential, device code or bearer link in this file.
 
 R1's later secure-box pastes are B2 application key, Healthchecks API key and Canvas calendar feed link. They are not requested yet because their consuming code is absent. UIUC forwarding and later institutional/source policy gates remain separate. Approval previously assigned to Claude does not prove this builder can perform the identity ceremony.
+
+## 2026-10-06T06:11:44.787205+00:00: bootstrap preparation is concrete; privileged execution pending
+
+The fixed toy bootstrap identities CLI is compiled. Eight real CLI cases prove non-root apply, caller-selected scope and disposable-stack refusals; the read-only local Directory Service plan returns DIRECTORY_QUERY_UNAVAILABLE and issues no IDs or snapshot. Full static checks pass 299 TS/Python artifacts, 231 contracts and 84 features/55 commands/1447 ATs. Root apply is unexecuted: the current caller is non-root and protected installation lies outside writable scope. No account, service, profile, browser, Keychain or model request was changed/run. The source remains a prerequisite, with all live identity/maintenance gates false. No manual setup or permission request is made here. R0.04 allows only its specified unavoidable administrator identity dialog when an authorized installer context is ready. Evidence: build/evidence/R0.04/identity-bootstrap-preparation.json.
