+## 2026-10-06T06:17:19.790778+00:00: R0.03 dashboard source prepared
+
+The bounded native dashboard patch now prepares sanitized HTTP 400 responses for credential persistence/AuthError/OSError failures. Three Python syntax checks and joint read-only applicability with the existing Hermes patches pass; installed Hermes is clean. The real scoped OAuth/save-fault/fresh-process matrix remains pending, and no supported login, browser, grant, Keychain, account, service or inference operation was executed. No human action is requested. Evidence: build/evidence/R0.03/dashboard-source-preparation.json.
